        <mxCell id="step0" value="1. Host calls a component export&lt;br&gt;Wasmtime lowers host values to the guest Canonical ABI" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dceafb;strokeColor=#4776aa;fontColor=#243746;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
